# Vendored cross-platform SQLite3 sources (committed — ginwasaas pattern).
# Provides prebuilt libsqlite3.a for Windows (via the MinGW symlink farm at
# vendor/sqlite3/libc-windows-amd64/) + macOS-{arm64,x86_64} so that
# `zig build install:windows` and `zig build install:macos*` link successfully
# on a Linux host WITHOUT needing vcpkg or brew installed locally.
#
# The legacy /vendor/ ignore was removed 2026-08-06 — see vendor/sqlite3/README.md
# for the layout + how the artifacts were produced. To bump SQLite: re-run
# the steps in vendor/sqlite3/README.md and replace vendor/sqlite3/amalgamation/
# with the new version's files.

